<ul>
<li><b>Quit from the menu bar.</b> Right-click the Rein icon for a quick menu: Open Rein, Reset Everything to macOS Auto, and Quit Rein.</li>
<li><b>Quit from Settings.</b> A Quit row now lives in Settings → General, with a plain statement of what happens when Rein closes.</li>
<li><b>Update checks are on by default.</b> The off-switch is in Settings → Updates.</li>
</ul></div>
]]></description>
